e built around couches and study booths.","evidence_claim":"UM-Dearborn reports that the renovated RUC study lounge includes couches, study booths, a fireplace, and updated seating.","source_url":"https://umdearborn.edu/um-dearborn-admissions-blog/top-10-study-spaces-campus","source_title":"Top 10 study spaces on campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-06-03","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Inside the James C. Renick University Center.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umdearborn-natural-science-building-study-areas","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Natural Science Building Study Areas","title":"Natural Science Building Study Areas","subtitle":"Natural Science Building, south end of campus","notes":"Try a different floor to find its color scheme and scenic view, then use the seating, charging stations, and whiteboards for group work.","short_summary":"Three floors of study areas with shared whiteboards and charging.","evidence_claim":"UM-Dearborn says the Natural Science Building has study areas across three floors with scenic views, whiteboards, markers, charging stations, and seating.","source_url":"https://umdearborn.edu/um-dearborn-admissions-blog/top-10-study-spaces-campus","source_title":"Top 10 study spaces on campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-06-03","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located at the south end of UM-Dearborn’s campus.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umdearborn-tony-england-engineering-lab-building","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Tony England Engineering Lab Building","title":"Tony England Engineering Lab Building","subtitle":"Engineering Lab Building (ELB)","notes":"Meet teammates in an open study area with large windows and whiteboards, or choose an enclosed lounge space when you need less activity.","short_summary":"Engineering building work zones ranging from open tables to enclosed lounges.","evidence_claim":"UM-Dearborn describes the ELB as having diverse study areas with large windows, whiteboards, accessible lighting, and more enclosed lounge spaces.","source_url":"https://umdearborn.edu/um-dearborn-admissions-blog/top-10-study-spaces-campus","source_title":"Top 10 study spaces on campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-06-03","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Known on campus as the Engineering Lab Building (ELB).","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umdearborn-ruc-patio","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"RUC Patio","title":"RUC Patio","subtitle":"Behind the Renick University Center","notes":"On a warm day, take coursework or conversation outdoors and use the patio seating between the CASL building and university center.","short_summary":"An outdoor study-and-hangout area behind the RUC.","evidence_claim":"UM-Dearborn identifies the patio behind the RUC as a warmer-month study and hangout spot with seating and access to CASL and the RUC.","source_url":"https://umdearborn.edu/um-dearborn-admissions-blog/top-10-study-spaces-campus","source_title":"Top 10 study spaces on campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-06-03","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located behind the Renick University Center; suited to warmer conditions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umdearborn-chancellors-pond","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Chancellor’s Pond","title":"Chancellor’s Pond","subtitle":"UM-Dearborn campus","notes":"Pack a book or lunch and use the stone benches or yellow chairs beside the pond; the fountain operates in spring, weather permitting.","short_summary":"A pond-side campus pause point with seating for reading or lunch.","evidence_claim":"UM-Dearborn says Chancellor’s Pond has a fountain brought to life each spring, plus yellow chairs and stone benches for lunch or reading.","source_url":"https://umdearborn.edu/um-dearborn-admissions-blog/top-10-study-spaces-campus","source_title":"Top 10 study spaces on campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-06-03","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor campus location; the source notes the fountain returns each spring.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
